handoffMarkdown:
Green GitHub Actions runs (R11.C2) on PR rayx-ui/RayX.SignalR#2, branch feat/production-grade-client.
- The user authorized pushing and running (2026-10-08) and raised the Actions budget on 2026-10-09.
- Green on 60a0f36, the head before the closeout docs:
  - Quality: https://github.com/rayx-ui/RayX.SignalR/actions/runs/37862871103
  - End-to-end: https://github.com/rayx-ui/RayX.SignalR/actions/runs/37862871128
  - Coverage: all transports; native ubuntu/windows/macos; browsers; Android; android-app; iOS; os-proxy on windows and macos; tls-aws-lc native x3, Android and iOS; HTTP/3 with libmsquic.
- 900 s soak (dispatched), success both times:
  - https://github.com/rayx-ui/RayX.SignalR/actions/runs/37845697880 (7cca360)
  - https://github.com/rayx-ui/RayX.SignalR/actions/runs/37854530727 (790eb5a)
- perf / compare: perf.yml can be dispatched only once it is on master (a workflow_dispatch rule). The full-scale ReferenceClientBudget run passed locally on 2026-10-08 (artifacts-temp/perf/reference-budget-20261008-*.txt). Dispatch perf / compare after the merge.
- Repairs during the run:
  - gradlew executable bit;
  - dead code on iOS and on Android without the verifier;
  - TLS-less unit tests;
  - Apple TLS refuses an h2-only ALPN offer with a protocol_version alert;
  - macOS suspension: the /bin/kill helper failed, so the runner now calls libc kill(2);
  - WebKit manual-reconnect wait raised to 30 s.
- User decisions: no push or schedule triggers (R11.C1 amended, revision 260); pull-request pushes touching only .agentx/** run nothing.
- Residual risks in docs/12 and interop-validation hypotheses:
  - a WebKit Long Polling connect hang, only in dispatched runs (4/4);
  - iOS simulator timing (stateful-reconnect, lifecycle-events), each passing on the next run;
  - one missed callback on Windows (callbacks/messagepack), which passed in the next run.
